Jericho the squire~
The squire Jericho rushes about here polishing armor and swords.
~
   Jericho is a fine looking young boy of about thirteen years.  He is of
medium build with wavy brown hair and piercing hazel eyes.  His goal in life is
to become a knight, he works extremely hard here in the shop to serve the guild
and his Uncle Thaniel.  Upon seeing your entrance, he gives a slight bow and
politefully asks of what assistance he may be.    
~
