Sir Thaniel~
A thickly built knight in silver armor stands here proudly.
~
   Upon looking closer, you notice the knight's breastplate is emblazoned with
the insignia of the order of the sword.  This is none other than Sir Thaniel of
the Sword, one of the knighthood's more legendary figures.  Thaniel is said to
be the best swordsman this side of the emerald sea, and rumored to have
disarmed Lord Skul of Blackheart in single combat.  Thaniel trains knights now
in the rudimentary skills of combat and devotion, teaching by example when he
gets the opportunity.    
~
