a Knight of the Sword~
A knight of the sword stands here, gazing intently at you.
~
   A member of the Order of the Sword, this gaunt looking knight has obviously
seen his share of combat.  His bearded face looks weary, but determined, much
like that of many experienced knights who have proved themselves in the rigors
of battle.  A contrast to this however is his eyes.  Serenely blue, they speak
of a calmness and compassion known only to one who is at peace with their God.
~
